{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_012mam_2000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_012mam_2000_place", "source_sha256": "61538fe10d0dd9651fd8c4d339439db3e5ef5b33795ac4e7527bd7039552a2df", "ja": "音楽スタジオ", "zh": "录音室", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_012mam_2000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_012mam_2001_012mam", "source_sha256": "3628b79a56d4e76c726bb3c393819c3a3f08a9eeba1a738e9d58d09377239a6f", "ja": "今日は、スタジオで収録かー。\n真美、ステージで歌うほうが好きかも！", "zh": "今天要在录音室录音啊──\n真美感觉比较喜欢在舞台上唱歌！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_012mam_2000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_012mam_2002_012mam", "source_sha256": "e4fdcae2f934e39e6cbfee83dbec2f45ac91623f090216277e631b01c66c450f", "ja": "やっぱ、ファンの兄ちゃんや姉ちゃんの顔が見えると\nめっちゃテンションあがるしー？", "zh": "还是要看到粉丝大哥哥跟大姊姊的脸，\n才会让人超兴奋呀──", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_012mam_2000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_012mam_2003_p", "source_sha256": "f9e7ed72e57edf34d92a62966659075d721334601482249b838f79f8d046fe0c", "ja": "おいおい、ここにも真美のファンがひとりいること\n忘れてないか？", "zh": "喂喂，你忘了这里也有一个\n真美的粉丝吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_012mam_2000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_012mam_2004_p", "source_sha256": "11f74bd56d282f4377dd4149095e840c70d049a4306ce06733451d4b73dac635", "ja": "俺は、真美がどこで歌っていても、\nずっと応援しているぞ？", "zh": "无论真美在哪里唱歌，\n我都会一直支持你喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_012mam_2000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_012mam_2005_012mam", "source_sha256": "e991c9d4f3275413a1452f92a46e29010cedc4e8599f36c5a4a30482de2e8edb", "ja": "……そっかあ、そういえば兄ちゃんがいたね。\n兄ちゃんは、真美の一番最初のファンだったんだっけ。", "zh": "……这样啊，这么说来大哥哥也在呢。\n记得大哥哥好像就是真美的第一号粉丝嘛？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_012mam_2000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_012mam_2006_012mam", "source_sha256": "c5c1041de7dd94acbc1fa1cc7c38ff6e02c1ff96d0a55e2a43bd95021ffe912e", "ja": "んじゃ、今日は真美、兄ちゃんのために歌うから、\nそこでちゃんと聞いててね！", "zh": "好啦，今天真美会为了大哥哥唱歌，\n你要在那里听清楚啰！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
